Script,BustOver2C
window.currentPBSScenario = 'BustOver2C';
window.currentPBSScenarioFilename = 'Bust_Over_Strong_2C';
console.log('PBS: Logging scenario selection for BustOver2C');
fetch('https://bba.harmonicsystems.com/api/scenario/select', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
        'X-Client-Version': '1.0.0'
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
        scenario: 'BustOver2C',
        user: whoAmI() || 'anonymous'
    })
}).then(function(r){ console.log('PBS: Server response', r.status); }).catch(function(e){ console.log('PBS: Fetch error', e); });
setDealerCode(`

/*
convention-card-ns: 21GF-DEFAULT
convention-card-ew: 21GF-GIB
auction-filter: Auction.....\n2C
*/
# South: strong, game-forcing 2C opener (22+ HCP)
s2C = hcp(south)>21

# North: exactly 3-1-3-6 (3S, 1H, 3D, 6C)
nShape = shape(north,3136)

# North holds the SJ and the CT and NO other honor cards (A,K,Q,J,T)
nSpades   = top5(north,spades)==1   and hascard(north,JS)
nHearts   = top5(north,hearts)==0
nDiamonds = top5(north,diamonds)==0
nClubs    = top5(north,clubs)==1    and hascard(north,TC)
nBust = nShape and nSpades and nHearts and nDiamonds and nClubs

s2C and nBust

produce 30
action printoneline,
`, "S", true)
Script
Button,Bust Over Strong 2C,\n\
--- Responding to a Strong 2C with a Bust\n\
Partner opens a game-forcing 2!C (22+ HCP) and you hold a near-worthless hand:\n\
3-1-3-6 with only the !SJ and the !CT，1 HCP and no other honors.\n\
Even opposite 22+ the partnership is rarely making game，but 2!C is forcing to\n\
at least 3 of a major (or game)，so you cannot pass. Bid the waiting 2!D，then\n\
make your second negative on the next round to warn partner the hand is dead.\n\
https://www.bridgebum.com/strong_2c.php\n\
%BustOver2C%
